Short:        Language and compiler as shared library
Author:       leif_salomonsson@swipnet.se
Uploader:     amigae swipnet se
Type:         dev/asm
Version:      v18
Replaces:     dev/asm/LittelComp.lha
Requires:     PhxAss/Lnk,020,OS3
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

Yeehaaa :)

This is a shared library used to compile littel language
sources, it uses PhxAss and PhxLnk for assembling and linking it.
A small frontend "lc17" is included.

Executables, libraries and objects can be created with ease.

I stopped development two years ago.

This is a never released v18 of LITTEL package.
Sourcecode in AmigaE is included.
Its FREEWARE.

Have fun,
Leif
